+/// - **macOS**: `SIOCGIFAFLAG_IN6` ioctl (`IN6_IFF_*` from [`<netinet6/in6_var.h>`][xnu])
+/// - **iOS**: unavailable in the public SDK; flags remain at their unknown/default values.
 /// - **FreeBSD/OpenBSD/NetBSD**: `SIOCGIFAFLAG_IN6` ioctl (`IN6_IFF_*` from [`<netinet6/in6_var.h>`][freebsd])
